/SUBROUTINE TO DIVIDE A DOUBLE PRECISION ARGUMENT BY A SINGLE PRECISION ONE
/ CALLING SEQUENCE:
/       JMS I   (DIVIDE
/       (ADDRESS OF DIVIDEND - DOUBLE PRECISION)
