        TAD     QUO
        RAL
        DCA     QUO
        ISZ     INDX1   /CHECK FOR ALL DONE
        JMP     LOOPX   /NOT YET
        ISZ     DIVIDE  /ADJUST RETURN
        JMP I   DIVIDE  /EXIT
